<!-- SECTION 1 -->
<h1>1. System Architecture Overview</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Technology</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Frontend</td><td>React 18 + Vite</td><td>Single-page application, dashboards, interactive UI</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Backend</td><td>Node.js + Express.js</td><td>REST API server, business logic, data persistence</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Database</td><td>Local JSON (data.json) + Supabase (cloud sync)</td><td>All business data storage scoped by shop ID</td></tr>
  <tr><td>AI Engine</td><td>Groq API (llama3-8b-8192)</td><td>4 specialized AI assistant models</td></tr>
  <tr><td>OCR Engine</td><td>Tesseract.js + NVIDIA Vision AI</td><td>Vendor invoice scan &amp; data extraction</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Webhooks</td><td>HTTP POST to external workflow URLs</td><td>Automated reports &amp; alerts to SNS iHub platform</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Authentication</td><td>Header-based RBAC (x-user-role, x-shop-id)</td><td>Tenant isolation &amp; role enforcement</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Key Architecture Principles</h3>
<p>• <strong>Tenant Isolation:</strong> Every database query is scoped to <code>req.shopId</code> to prevent cross-shop data leakage.</p>
<p>• <strong>Role-Based Access:</strong> All sensitive routes use <code>requireRoles()</code> middleware before processing.</p>
<p>• <strong>Single Source of Truth:</strong> All modules read from the same backend API — no stale localStorage data inconsistencies.</p>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 2 -->
<h1>2. Authentication Module</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/auth.js</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/auth/login</code></td>
    <td><strong>User Login</strong></td>
    <td>Accepts userId/email/mobile + password. Searches users table and returns full user profile including role and owner_id. Supports Business Owner and Employee login from the same endpoint.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/auth/signup</code></td>
    <td><strong>New Account Registration</strong></td>
    <td>Creates a new Business Owner or Employee account. Auto-generates unique user ID (OWNER-XXXX for owners, EMP-XXXX for employees). Validates for duplicate mobile number or email. Stores hashed password.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/auth/users</code></td>
    <td><strong>List All Users</strong></td>
    <td>Returns sanitized user list (no password_hash). Used by the dashboard to populate employee/user dropdowns and verify accounts.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h4>Frontend Functions (LoginPage.jsx / SignupPage.jsx)</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function Name</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleLogin()</code></td><td>Validates form, calls <code>apiLogin()</code>, stores user session in localStorage, routes to dashboard by role.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleSignup()</code></td><td>Collects business owner registration data, calls <code>apiSignup()</code>, auto-redirects after success.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleRoleToggle()</code></td><td>Switches login form between Business Owner and Employee modes.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 3 -->
<h1>3. Dashboard Overview & KPI Engine</h1>
<p><strong>Files:</strong> <code>backend/routes/dashboard.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/pages/BusinessOwnerDashboard.jsx</code> (OverviewModule)</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/dashboard/stats</code></td>
    <td><strong>Live KPI Statistics</strong></td>
    <td>Computes real-time KPIs from live database: total invoice value, GST claimable, low stock count, high-risk invoices, active fraud alerts, pending customer bills count &amp; amount. All data scoped to shop's owner ID.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/dashboard/notifications</code></td>
    <td><strong>Live Notifications Feed</strong></td>
    <td>Returns fraud alerts + auto-generated salary due reminders (3 days before salary date). Employees near salary date trigger automatic MEDIUM severity notifications.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h4>OverviewModule Frontend Functions</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function / State</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>useEffect → apiGetDashboardStats()</code></td><td>Fetches live KPI data from backend on mount and populates all 4 KPI cards.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>livePendingBillsCount / livePendingBillsAmount</code></td><td>Reads pending customer credit bills from backend stats (same source as PendingBillsModule — no mismatch).</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>Pending Bills KPI Card onClick</code></td><td>Clickable card that navigates user directly to the Pending Bills page using <code>onNavigate('pending_bills')</code>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>processStock()</code></td><td>Deduplicates and aggregates stock items from multiple sources (Supabase, backend API, localStorage) and renders top 3 lowest-stock items.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>setFraudFeedAlerts()</code></td><td>Compiles security alerts from duplicate bill detection and pending payment flags for the AI Intelligence Feed widget.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 4 -->
<h1>4. Vendor Invoice Management (OCR + Manual Entry)</h1>
<p><strong>Files:</strong> <code>backend/routes/invoices.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/pages/UploadInvoiceFullPage.jsx</code>, <code>frontend/src/pages/CreateInvoiceFullPage.jsx</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/invoices</code></td>
    <td><strong>Get All Invoices</strong></td>
    <td>Returns all vendor/supplier invoices for the authenticated shop. Accessible by owner, financier, cashier roles.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/invoices</code></td>
    <td><strong>Create Manual Invoice</strong></td>
    <td>Manually create a new vendor bill. Auto-runs duplicate detection. If duplicate found, flags as High Risk and creates a fraud alert. Auto-updates inventory stock if item list provided.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/invoices/upload</code></td>
    <td><strong>Save OCR-Extracted Invoice</strong></td>
    <td>Saves AI-parsed invoice data extracted from scanned images. Runs duplicate check, updates inventory automatically.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/invoices/scan-file</code></td>
    <td><strong>OCR Image Scanning</strong></td>
    <td>Accepts uploaded image (JPG/PNG/PDF). Uses Tesseract.js for OCR text extraction followed by NVIDIA Vision AI for structured data parsing (supplier, invoice number, items, totals). Returns extracted JSON.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h4>Key Helper Functions (invoices.js)</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>normalizeInvoiceNo(no)</code></td><td>Strips special characters and lowercases invoice numbers for consistent duplicate matching.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>normalizeName(str)</code></td><td>Normalizes supplier names for fuzzy duplicate detection.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>checkDuplicateInDb()</code></td><td>Runs 2-step duplicate check: (1) exact invoice number match, (2) same supplier + same grand total within ₹5 tolerance. Returns isDuplicate flag and reason.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 5 -->
<h1>5. Inventory & Stock Management</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/inventory.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/components/dashboard/InventoryReadOnlyModule.jsx</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Access</th></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory</code></td><td><strong>View All Stock</strong></td><td><span class="badge all">All Roles</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory</code></td><td><strong>Add New SKU</strong></td><td><span class="badge owner">Owner / Store Manager</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-put">PUT</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory/:id</code></td><td><strong>Update Stock Item</strong></td><td><span class="badge owner">Owner / Store Manager</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory/:id</code></td><td><strong>Delete SKU</strong></td><td><span class="badge owner">Owner Only</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory/webhook/trigger</code></td><td><strong>Trigger Stock Webhook Event</strong></td><td><span class="badge all">All</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory/webhook/stock-updates</code></td><td><strong>Secondary Webhook Listener</strong></td><td><span class="badge all">All</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/inventory/webhook/logs</code></td><td><strong>Webhook Event Logs</strong></td><td><span class="badge all">All</span></td></tr>
</table>

<p>When a new item is added or updated, stock status auto-updates: <strong>Low Stock Alert</strong> (if qty ≤ threshold) or <strong>Healthy Stock</strong>. Every change creates an audit log entry.</p>
<p>Stock is automatically adjusted when vendor invoices are saved — items in the invoice are matched and quantity is added to existing inventory records.</p>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 6 -->
<h1>6. Customer POS Billing System</h1>
<p><strong>Files:</strong> <code>backend/routes/customer_bills.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/components/dashboard/PosBillingModule.jsx</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/customer-bills</code></td>
    <td><strong>Get All Customer Bills</strong></td>
    <td>Returns all POS bills for the shop (Paid + Pending). Filtered strictly by shop ID.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/customer-bills</code></td>
    <td><strong>Create New POS Bill</strong></td>
    <td>Creates a customer sale bill. Supports two payment modes: (1) <strong>Paid</strong> — immediately creates a transaction ledger entry as income; (2) <strong>Pending Payment (Credit)</strong> — bill saved for later collection with optional due date.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-put">PUT</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/customer-bills/:id/pay</code></td>
    <td><strong>Mark Bill as Paid</strong></td>
    <td>Settles a pending customer credit bill. Creates transaction record (income), writes audit log. Triggers webhook event for stock deduction tracking.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h4>POS Frontend Functions (PosBillingModule.jsx)</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleAddItem()</code></td><td>Searches inventory and adds items to the current sale cart.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>calculateTotals()</code></td><td>Auto-computes subtotal, GST (18%), grand total from cart items.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleCheckout()</code></td><td>Submits the sale, supports Paid/Credit modes, triggers stock webhook.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>handleBarcodeScan()</code></td><td>Processes barcode input to auto-populate item details from inventory.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 7 -->
<h1>7. Pending Bills Manager</h1>
<p><strong>Location:</strong> Within <code>BusinessOwnerDashboard.jsx</code> (PendingBillsModule function)</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>View Pending Bills</strong></td><td>Fetches all customer bills with status "Pending" or "Pending Payment (Credit)" from backend API.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Settle Bill</strong></td><td>Calls <code>PUT /api/customer-bills/:id/pay</code> to mark bill as paid, creating a transaction entry.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Due Date Display</strong></td><td>Shows color-coded due date (red if overdue, yellow if due within 3 days).</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Dashboard Card Link</strong></td><td>The "Pending Credit Bills" KPI card on the main dashboard is clickable and navigates to this page. Count shown matches exactly what this page shows.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 8 -->
<h1>8. Expense Tracker</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/expenses.js</code></p>
<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/expenses</code></td><td>Retrieve all shop expenses filtered by shop ID</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/expenses</code></td><td>Record a new business expense (rent, utilities, etc.)</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Salary payouts automatically create expense records (category: "Staff Salary") ensuring P&amp;L accuracy.</p>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 9 -->
<h1>9. Transaction Ledger</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/transactions.js</code></p>
<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/transactions</code></td><td>Full transaction ledger — all IN and OUT entries for the shop</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/transactions</code></td><td>Create a manual transaction entry</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Transactions are auto-created for: POS paid sales (IN), salary payouts (OUT), pending bill settlements (IN).</p>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 10 -->
<h1>10. Employee Management & Salary Payout</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/employees.js</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/employees</code></td>
    <td><strong>List Employees</strong></td>
    <td>Returns all employees of the shop. Owner-only endpoint.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/employees</code></td>
    <td><strong>Add Employee</strong></td>
    <td>Creates a new employee record with name, role, phone, salary amount, and salary due date. Also creates the matching login account (via signup).</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-delete">DELETE</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/employees/:id</code></td>
    <td><strong>Remove Employee</strong></td>
    <td>Deletes an employee record from the shop database.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-put">PUT</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/employees/:id/pay-salary</code></td>
    <td><strong>Process Salary Payout</strong></td>
    <td>Marks salary as paid for the month. Creates: (1) expense record for P&amp;L, (2) transaction OUT record, (3) payment history entry, (4) audit log. Updates employee payment_status to Paid.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="note">
  <strong>Note:</strong> Employees are always data-isolated — they can only see data from their owner's shop. Salary reminders are auto-generated 3 days before the salary due date.
</div>

<hr>

