<!-- SECTION 12 -->
<h1>12. AI Assistant — 4 Specialized Models</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/ai.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/components/dashboard/AiAssistantModule.jsx</code></p>
<p>All 4 models use the <strong>Groq API (llama3-8b-8192)</strong> with different API keys and system prompts. Each model receives live store data as real-time context.</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Model</th><th>Assistant Name</th><th>API Key Env Var</th><th>Specialization</th></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>finance</strong></td><td>Finance Analyst</td><td><code>GROQ_API_KEY_FINANCE</code></td><td>P&amp;L analysis, cash flow, GST guidance, cost optimization, tax advisory.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>inventory</strong></td><td>Stock Manager</td><td><code>GROQ_API_KEY_INVENTORY</code></td><td>Stock level analysis, reorder predictions, dead stock identification, supplier suggestions.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>vendor</strong></td><td>Vendor Advisor</td><td><code>GROQ_API_KEY_VENDOR</code></td><td>Vendor comparison, bulk discount recommendations, purchase history analysis.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>fraud_growth</strong></td><td>Fraud &amp; Growth AI</td><td><code>GROQ_API_KEY_FRAUD_GROWTH</code></td><td>Fraud detection alerts, duplicate bill analysis, business growth strategies, marketing advice.</td></tr>
</table>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-get">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/ai/insights</code></td><td>Returns pre-computed AI insights (financial, stock, recommendations, compliance). Owner only.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/ai/chat</code></td><td>Conversational AI endpoint. Accepts query, companyName, assistantType. Routes to correct Groq model. Falls back to offline analysis if API unavailable.</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Key Backend Function: <code>getStoreContextData(shopId)</code></h4>
<p>Computes comprehensive real-time store metrics passed to AI as context:</p>
<p>Total Sales Revenue | Total Expenses | Estimated Profit | Net Margin | Stock Valuation | Low Stock Items | Recent Transactions | Vendor List</p>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 13 -->
<h1>13. Automated Reports & Webhook Engine</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/routes/reports.js</code></p>
<p>All 4 endpoints analyze live store data and POST structured JSON payloads to <code>WEBHOOK_URL_1</code> configured in <code>backend/.env</code>.</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/reports/send-daily</code></td>
    <td><strong>2-Day Activity Report</strong></td>
    <td>Analyzes all transactions, sales, and alerts from the past 48 hours. Sends summary including sales total, bills raised, pending bills, low stock alerts, and recent transaction list to webhook.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/reports/send-weekly</code></td>
    <td><strong>Weekly Performance Report</strong></td>
    <td>7-day analysis of sales, expenses, and profit. Calls Groq Finance AI model to generate a 3-4 bullet executive summary. Sends combined report with AI insights to webhook.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/reports/send-reminders</code></td>
    <td><strong>Business Reminders</strong></td>
    <td>Compiles three types of reminders: (1) Salary payments due within 5 days, (2) Outstanding customer credit bills, (3) Low stock items below threshold. Sends prioritized reminder list to webhook.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><span class="badge method-post">POST</span></td>
    <td><code>/api/reports/growth-advice</code></td>
    <td><strong>AI Growth Advisory</strong></td>
    <td>Uses Groq Fraud &amp; Growth AI model to analyze store snapshot and generate 5 specific, data-backed business growth strategies. Sends AI advice + store snapshot to webhook.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h4>Key Helper Functions (reports.js)</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>getFullStoreContext(shopId)</code></td><td>Returns complete store data: sales, expenses, pending bills, low stock, salary due employees, vendor count — all scoped to shopId.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>filterByDays(items, daysBack)</code></td><td>Filters any data array to only records created within the past N days.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>sendToWebhook(payload)</code></td><td>Posts JSON payload to WEBHOOK_URL_1. Returns {ok, status}. Logs failure gracefully.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>callGroqAI(apiKey, systemPrompt, userPrompt)</code></td><td>Makes authenticated Groq API call with configured system context. Returns AI text response.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 14 -->
<h1>14. Settings & Configuration</h1>
<p><strong>Files:</strong> <code>backend/routes/settings.js</code>, <code>frontend/src/components/dashboard/SettingsModule.jsx</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Tab / Section</th><th>Function</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Business Profile</td><td>Update company name, legal name, GSTIN, PAN, business type, registration date.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Shop Information</td><td>Update store code, branch name, address, phone, email, currency, timezone, operating hours.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>User Profile</td><td>View current logged-in user details (name, ID, email, phone, role).</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Change Password</td><td>Securely update user password via <code>POST /api/settings/change-password</code>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Security Settings</td><td>Configure 2FA, session timeout, password strength enforcement, multi-device login.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Role Management</td><td>View and manage employee roles and permissions matrix.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>App Preferences</td><td>Set invoice prefix, date format. Trigger 4 report actions (see Section 13).</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Logout</td><td>Clears localStorage session and redirects to login page.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- SECTION 15 -->
<h1>15. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)</h1>
<p><strong>File:</strong> <code>backend/middleware/rbac.js</code></p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Role</th><th>Accessible Modules</th></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>owner</strong></td><td>All modules: Dashboard, Analytics, Invoices, Inventory, POS, Employees, AI, Reports, Settings, Pending Bills</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>cashier</strong></td><td>POS Billing, Customer Bills, Inventory (read-only), Pending Bills</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>financier</strong></td><td>Invoices, Expenses, Transactions, Reports, Customer Bills</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>store_manager</strong></td><td>Inventory (full), POS, Vendors</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>accountant</strong></td><td>Transactions, Expenses, Reports</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Middleware Functions</h4>
<table>
  <tr><th>Function</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>validateShopIsolation()</code></td><td>Extracts x-user-role, x-user-id, x-shop-id from request headers. Sets req.shopId for all subsequent database queries. Applied to all business data routes.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>requireRoles(roles[])</code></td><td>Checks if req.userRole is in the allowed roles array. Returns 403 Forbidden if not authorized.</td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

